<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>确认预定 · flever 花艺定制</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="phone active">

  <nav class="rise">
    <div class="nav-back" onclick="history.back()">‹ 返回</div>
    <div style="margin-left:auto;font-size:14px;font-weight:var(--w-semi)">确认预定</div>
    <div style="width:34px"></div>
  </nav>

  <section style="margin-top:26px" class="confirm-sec rise">
    <div class="confirm-label"><span class="cn">你的选题</span><span class="edit" onclick="history.back()">修改</span></div>
    <div class="recap">
      <div class="r-img">意境图</div>
      <div><h3><%= topic %></h3><p>花艺师工作笔记选题 · 制作前可自由改</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="confirm-sec reveal">
    <div class="confirm-label"><span class="cn">你的档位</span><span class="edit" onclick="history.back()">修改</span></div>
    <div class="recap">
      <div style="flex:1">
        <h3><%= tier.name %></h3>
        <p><%= tier.desc %> · 手工包装</p>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:20px;font-weight:var(--w-semi)">¥<%= tier.price / 100 %></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="confirm-sec reveal rd1">
    <div class="confirm-label"><span class="cn">你的排期</span></div>
    <div class="gantt-card">
      <div class="g-row"><div class="g-label">新订单</div><div class="g-track"><div class="g-bar mine" style="left:8%;width:60%">最早可排 <%= schedule %></div></div></div>
      <div class="gantt-note">名额按下单顺序锁定；<b>点击付款后锁定 30 分钟</b>，超时未付自动释放。</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="reveal rd1">
    <div class="pay-total"><span>合计</span><b><%= tier.price / 100 %></b></div>
    <form action="/order/create" method="post">
      <input type="hidden" name="formId" value="<%= formId %>">
      <input type="hidden" name="topic" value="<%= topic %>">
      <input type="hidden" name="tier" value="<%= tier.name %>">
      <button class="btn-cta" style="width:100%">确认付款</button>
    </form>
    <div class="queue-line" style="margin-top:12px">点击后锁定名额并唤起微信支付 · 30 分钟内未付款自动释放</div>
  </section>

</div>
</body>
</html>
